Subject: [PATCH] stream: include cstdint for uint8_t

Stream.cpp uses uint8_t directly but only received its declaration through
transitive includes with older toolchains. Include the standard header that
owns the fixed-width integer type so GCC 14 can compile the source reliably.

Patch-Source: openEuler RISC-V package CI failure analysis
Patch-License: MIT
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes are not authorized)
---
 Stream.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Stream.cpp b/Stream.cpp
--- a/Stream.cpp
+++ b/Stream.cpp
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
  */
 
 #include "Stream.h"
+#include <cstdint>
 
 
 void Stream::forward_directly(Stream &output, std::size_t len)
